_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"shurutech/mql","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:21:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_331532094aac49018953e5f34584aa2a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_17e197f4fe12cc5875051e30de10e2fa609456dae2e4b1ef16da10dc2d5d164f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"MQL (My Query Language) transforms natural language queries into executable SQL, intended for users without coding knowledge, using a connected or uploaded database schema."},{"claim_ids":["clm_21e477033f9280e1107785b19a8869821ec5b87e9d95d508bc4e4e44523ccc2e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool depends on an OpenAI API key, which must be set via OPENAI_API_KEY in the server Dockerfile or server/.env."},{"claim_ids":["clm_421bf9c7b72b7f2a349bd4521ca4a1228d0db60523dcabb36c3c3e0ea50808d6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"As of the current version, MQL is designed to work exclusively with PostgreSQL; MySQL support is only listed as a planned future feature."},{"claim_ids":["clm_779c6aef89e4af80ab10eb87f0d8be4673588916e7f3dadd1823056de371d1fa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: bug reports should first check the issue tracker and include a clear description, reproduction steps, expected vs actual behavior, and error messages or screenshots."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7ba2adb96f61fb7cf8744c971ba705f133acf5c0254dccf1a4447316d227636d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors should fork the repo, use focused branches, write clear commits, follow coding standards, add tests where possible, and submit pull requests with issue references; a Code of Conduct applies."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7c6b217f580737390807d1170302d58cd3573e1319f359b9baaa86e9e953579f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The use of the pgvector extension and a vector database setup suggests MQL likely uses embeddings for schema or query matching, though the README does not state this mechanism explicitly."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a13517dad52e39bc569defd6f5aa600d76d14267fc5b84ecf2546b2a5bd0e256"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: local Docker setup requires cloning the repo, setting OPENAI_API_KEY and DATABASE_URL, then running make install; make up, make restart, and make down manage containers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6306cd3b7f916fa7a445e2a9753641a5473ec0bd63c1d3ea9d7c76261cca850"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A default login user (admin@example.com / admin) is created when running via Docker; production guidance says to delete it and create users via a scripts/create_user.py script inside the backend container."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de4a278456a1e93b4dfdeb161c0e66d14ff664cf0499769f197d2f4f461f9b35"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"After installation, the MQL dashboard is accessible at http://localhost:3000."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e17c860981023edb7c8789ba60bf174a1f1249e0c35cbfb319b9bd3230e0959c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Testing with 50 natural language queries against an elearning schema yielded roughly 85% success (43/50 translated), with about 74% (37/50) executing perfectly and 7 queries erroring."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e34f9d4af10f8cf534983fdaa85cd81b7d678e275929f8efe1f40da31a41dbe4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Query execution is not yet implemented; it is listed among planned next-release features, along with natural language responses, data visualization, and Slack integration."}],"claim_ids":["clm_17e197f4fe12cc5875051e30de10e2fa609456dae2e4b1ef16da10dc2d5d164f","clm_21e477033f9280e1107785b19a8869821ec5b87e9d95d508bc4e4e44523ccc2e","clm_421bf9c7b72b7f2a349bd4521ca4a1228d0db60523dcabb36c3c3e0ea50808d6","clm_779c6aef89e4af80ab10eb87f0d8be4673588916e7f3dadd1823056de371d1fa","clm_7ba2adb96f61fb7cf8744c971ba705f133acf5c0254dccf1a4447316d227636d","clm_7c6b217f580737390807d1170302d58cd3573e1319f359b9baaa86e9e953579f","clm_a13517dad52e39bc569defd6f5aa600d76d14267fc5b84ecf2546b2a5bd0e256","clm_b6306cd3b7f916fa7a445e2a9753641a5473ec0bd63c1d3ea9d7c76261cca850","clm_de4a278456a1e93b4dfdeb161c0e66d14ff664cf0499769f197d2f4f461f9b35","clm_e17c860981023edb7c8789ba60bf174a1f1249e0c35cbfb319b9bd3230e0959c","clm_e34f9d4af1